<title>UK: Gulf Canada not to pay final div for Clyde.</title>
<headline>Gulf Canada not to pay final div for Clyde.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Clyde Petroleum said on Thursday that it has been informed by Gulf Canada that it would not pay a final dividend to Clyde's shareholders.</p>
<p>Gulf Canada recently won control of Clyde by making an offer of 120 pence per share.</p>
<p>The offer was declared unconditional on February 19.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
